# Streamlabs

> Streamlabs is a live streaming software developer that creates tools designed to make it simple for streamers to go live from their computer, mobile device, browser, or Xbox console while enabling deep customization through stream overlays, alerts, widgets, chatbots, and more. Robust monetization options allow creators to earn money through tips, customized merchandise sales, and sponsorships.

## Products
[Streamlabs Desktop](https://streamlabs.com/streamlabs-live-streaming-software): Comprehensive software for live streaming and recording, offering advanced tools for content creation, audience engagement, and monetization.
[Streamlabs Mobile](https://streamlabs.com/mobile-app): Mobile live streaming app available on iOS and Android for creating, managing, and sharing content directly from smartphones, tailored for IRL and mobile gaming live streams.
[Streamlabs Console](https://streamlabs.com/console): End-to-end solution for live streaming directly from Xbox to Twitch, YouTube, Kick, and TikTok, without a capture card or PC enabling seamless content sharing and real-time audience interaction.
[Streamlabs Plugin for OBS](https://streamlabs.com/obs-plugin): Performance-enhancing plugin for OBS Studio, providing access to Streamlabs features like overlays, alerts, widgets, and multistreaming.
[Streamlabs Talk Studio](https://streamlabs.com/talk-studio): Browser-based platform designed for hosting podcasts, interviews, and professional virtual discussions.
[Streamlabs Video Editor](https://streamlabs.com/video-editor): User-friendly video editing tool for creators to fine-tune, repurpose, and enhance their live or recorded content.
[Streamlabs Podcast Editor](https://streamlabs.com/podcast-editor): Text-based video editing tool for editing and generating clips from podcast and live stream content. Features tools for trimming, formatting for vertical social platforms, and distribution.
[Streamlabs Cross Clip](https://streamlabs.com/cross-clip): Tool for converting live streams into shareable short-form videos for platforms like TikTok, YouTube Shorts, and Instagram Reels.
[Streamlabs Link Space](https://streamlabs.com/link-space): Customizable link-in-bio for streamers to centralize links to social media, channels, and merchandise.
[Streamlabs Ultra](https://streamlabs.com/ultra): Premium subscription plan for live streamers looking to grow and build their brand with tools like multistreaming, access to all stream overlays and Apps in the Streamlabs library, and more.
[Streamlabs Charity](https://streamlabscharity.com/): All-in-one platform for fundraising and charity live streams, facilitating campaigns and donor engagement with no fees taken by Streamlabs.

## Features
[Multistreaming](https://streamlabs.com/multistream): Solution for broadcasting live streams simultaneously across multiple platforms such as Twitch, YouTube, Kick, and TikTok utilizing Streamlabs' servers for improved performance vs local multistreaming options.
[Intelligent Streaming Agent](https://streamlabs.com/intelligent-streaming-agent): AI-driven live stream co-host who can chat with users, live producer that updates the user's stream based on automations, and tech support that assists in fixing issues with user live streams.
[Cloudbot](https://streamlabs.com/cloudbot): Cloud-based chatbot for stream automation, featuring custom commands, giveaways, and moderation functionalities.
[Desktop Chat Bot](https://streamlabs.com/desktop-chatbot): Downloadable chatbot software to manage audience interaction, commands, and automation from a local desktop environment.
[Stream Overlays and Widget Themes](https://streamlabs.com/themes): A collection of customizable themes, overlays, stream scenes, and templates for live stream personalization with options for AI-supported dynamic overlays for select games.
[Sponsorships](https://streamlabs.com/sponsorships): Platform to connect creators of any size with sponsorship opportunities, enabling brand collaborations and monetization.
[Tipping](https://streamlabs.com/donations): Secure donation platform helping creators receive financial support directly from their viewers with no platform cut from Streamlabs.
[App Store](https://streamlabs.com/sl-desktop-app-store): Centralized marketplace for discovering and installing apps to enhance stream functionality and engagement.
[Collab Cam](https://streamlabs.com/collab-cam): Feature that allows creators to invite guests to their streams via webcam, perfect for co-streams or interviews.
[Highlighter](https://streamlabs.com/highlighter): Tool to clip, edit, and share the best moments from past streams for promoting engagement and replay value. Enhances with AI-driven automatic clipping for select games.
[Merch Store](https://streamlabs.com/merch): Integrated solution for creators to design, sell, and distribute custom merchandise directly to their audience.
[Twitch Panel Maker](https://streamlabs.com/twitch-panel-maker): Easy, free tool for creating professional and visually appealing Twitch channel panels.
[Widgets](https://streamlabs.com/widgets): Elements available in Streamlabs Desktop, Streamlabs Plugin for OBS, and via browser source that allow creators to customize their live streams.

### Stream Widgets
[Alert Box](https://streamlabs.com/widgets/alert-box): Fully customizable widget to display real-time alerts for viewer interactions, such as follows, donations, and subscriptions.
[Chat Box](https://streamlabs.com/desktop-widgets/chat-box): Live chat overlay for highlighting audience messages directly on a stream in customizable styles.
[Event List](https://streamlabs.com/desktop-widgets/event-list): Dynamic list showcasing recent stream activity, including subs, donations, and follows.
[Tip and Follower Goals](https://streamlabs.com/desktop-widgets/goals): Visual tracker for achieving audience follower growth and tip receipt goals during a live stream.
[Game Widget](https://streamlabs.com/desktop-widgets/game-widget): Interactive overlay that allows streamers to integrate customizable mini-games into their streams.
[The Jar](https://streamlabs.com/desktop-widgets/tip-jar): Engaging widget where followers, tips, and subscriptions visually fill a jar, adding an interactive element to streams.
[Stream Boss](https://streamlabs.com/desktop-widgets/stream-boss): Gamified overlay that challenges viewers to 'defeat' the current stream boss by engaging via subs, donations, or bits.
[End Credits](https://streamlabs.com/desktop-widgets/end-credits): Closing credits sequence automatically generated to thank contributors such as followers, subs, and donors.
[Sponsor Banner](https://streamlabs.com/desktop-widgets/sponsor-banner): Rotating sponsorship banner to display supported brands or featured messages during a live stream.
[Spin Wheel](https://streamlabs.com/desktop-widgets/spin-wheel): Randomized prize wheel to engage audiences during giveaways or interactive events.
[Tip Ticker](https://streamlabs.com/desktop-widgets/tip-ticker): Scrolling ticker that highlights recent tips and donations during live streams.
[Viewer Count](https://streamlabs.com/desktop-widgets/viewer-counter): Real-time display of live viewer numbers to keep creators and audiences informed during streams.

